@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Historial 3: POST /api/v1/driver/transport-orders/:orderId/count-sessions/initial

actor "Chofer" as Driver
participant "App Móvil Chofer" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Driver Count Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "count_sessions DB\n(transport_order_count_sessions)" as SessionDB
participant "session_items DB\n(transport_order_count_session_items)" as SessionItemsDB
participant "truck_inventories DB" as InvDB
participant "order_histories DB\n(transport_order_histories)" as HistoryDB

Driver -> App: Abre carga en rampa, cuenta físicamente productos y plasma firma
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/driver/transport-orders/100451/count-sessions/initial\n(DriverCountPayloadDto)
Gateway -> Service: processDriverInitialCount(orderId: 100451, payload, driverId)

Service -> TX: 1. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> SessionDB: 2. insertCountSession(orderId, 'DRIVER_INITIAL', driverId)
note right of SessionDB
  Registra sesión:
  - session_type = 'DRIVER_INITIAL'
  - status = 'COMPLETED'
  - executor_role = 'DRIVER'
  - executor_id = driverId
  - completed_at = NOW()
end note
SessionDB --> Service: newSessionId: 101

Service -> SessionItemsDB: 3. insertCountSessionItems(101, payload.items)
note right of SessionItemsDB
  Registra por cada producto:
  - counted_qty = (cajas * factor) + unidades
  - variance_qty = counted_qty - expected_qty
  - item_status = (variance == 0 ? 'MATCH' : 'MISMATCH')
end note
SessionItemsDB --> Service: ok

alt Todas las variance_qty == 0 (100% MATCH - Sin diferencias)
  Service -> InvDB: 4a. updateTruckInventoriesStatus(100451, 'MATCH')
  InvDB --> Service: ok

  Service -> OrdersDB: 4b. updateOrderStatus(100451, 'CHECKED_OK')
  OrdersDB --> Service: ok

  Service -> HistoryDB: 4c. insertOrderHistory(100451, 'CHECKED_START', 'Conteo chofer 100% conforme')
  HistoryDB --> Service: ok

else Existe al menos una variance_qty != 0 (MISMATCH - Descuadre)
  Service -> InvDB: 4d. updateTruckInventoriesStatus(100451, 'MISMATCH')
  InvDB --> Service: ok

  Service -> OrdersDB: 4e. updateOrderStatus(100451, 'DISCREPANCY')
  OrdersDB --> Service: ok

  Service -> HistoryDB: 4f. insertOrderHistory(100451, 'DIF O REVISION END', 'Conteo con diferencias; derivado a supervisor')
  HistoryDB --> Service: ok
end

Service -> TX: 5. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (DriverCountResult: { status: 'MATCH' | 'DISCREPANCY', sessionId: 101 })
Gateway --> App: 200 OK
App --> Driver: Muestra confirmación de conteo enviado y firma registrada
@enduml
